    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπτι-ότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>supine position,</i> of leaves, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.10.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a river,
				<i>flatness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.3.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>supineness, calmness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.122
			</span></i>; of style, <i>flatness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>slackness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				15.64
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
